&h=200&s=89619594685cbb1259b915d7d9abb207, https://si.imgix.net/2800a045/uploads/origins/8d04fd62-5ece-4fbd-8512-96337aca9441?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26997fe6a81d87599c6835115bc91fe0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2800a045/uploads/origins/8d04fd62-5ece-4fbd-8512-96337aca9441?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b03ca730707b3020f82416bcc504300 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\nSkebを見ていて、あなたのページを見つけました。あなたの作風がとても気に入ったので、ぜひお願いしたいです！私のOC、マヤを描いてほしいです！槍を持ったポーズがとても似合うと思います！\nこれからもよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/zKUnmza", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@warabe3e3/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1279e7a6/uploads/origins/4834092f-e109-49b1-8b21-fb4828c0d85e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=709bef1cc4d0638c3829ce40ec6cb686", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1279e7a6/uploads/origins/4834092f-e109-49b1-8b21-fb4828c0d85e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=709bef1cc4d0638c3829ce40ec6cb686, https://si.imgix.net/1279e7a6/uploads/origins/4834092f-e109-49b1-8b21-fb4828c0d85e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=49c0be745a589e4d24d97040027ab62b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1279e7a6/uploads/origins/4834092f-e109-49b1-8b21-fb4828c0d85e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f18f81b8e4524f03ac3843558259544a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you so much for the appeal わらべ敵しおん-san,  I would love to request you!!\n\nYour art is super cool and I'd love to see you draw my character!!\n\nPlease feel free to draw her however you would like, pose and outfit are all up to you! ^^ She has a crow friend, but you do not have to include them if you do not want to. I can't wait to see what you have in mind and I hope you have a fun time with it!\n\nI would like a version with